                        <br/> Inactive ingredients</content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>citric acid, FD&amp;C Red No. 40, flavor, glycerin, polyethylene glycol, propylene glycol, purified water, saccharin sodium, sodium benzoate, sodium citrate, sorbitol and sucralose.</paragraph>
                  <paragraph/>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20140624"/>
            </section>
